Subject: [PATCH 025/105] hc: three-kernel norm+mix (K0 stats/normalize/zero,
 K1 split-K down-proj with atomics, K2 up-proj+gate+mean), SGLANG_HC_MIX2=1

Non-persistent replacement for grouped_gemma_rmsnorm + the persistent
fused_hc_mix chain. Graph-timed on RTX PRO 6000 with 24 rotating weight
copies: 19.5-20.7us -> 14.6-16.4us at M=1/4/16 (the two 6.5 MB matrices
alone stream in ~11.5us on this card, so this sits near the floor). normed is
bit-exact, mixed max-abs <= 1e-3 vs the reference chain. 4 GPU tests pass.
Implemented by an Opus subagent; reviewed by the supervisor. Default off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
